flowchart TD
  MAN["axiom-extension.toml — the manifest<br/>[extension] name · version · license · owner<br/>[[extension.provides]] one block per capability"]:::core
  MAN --> PROV["[[extension.provides]]<br/>declares one or more capability kinds"]:::core
  PROV --> K1["agent<br/>LLM-backed persona · persistent identity + state"]:::core
  K1 --> K2["tool<br/>stateless callable · typed invoke(input) to output"]:::core
  K2 --> K3["cmd<br/>CLI noun + imperative verbs (axi …)"]:::core
  K3 --> K4["service<br/>long-running daemon · start/stop/health"]:::core
  K4 --> K5["adapter<br/>third-party integration · classification ceiling"]:::core
  K5 --> K6["skill<br/>(params, ctx) to SkillResult · SkillRegistry"]:::accent
  K6 --> K7["hook<br/>lifecycle interceptor · event-bus subjects"]:::core
  K7 --> K8["prompt<br/>MCP prompt template · cross-harness gravity"]:::core
  K6 --> PROJ["The skill is the single source of truth<br/>it projects to CLI verb · MCP tool · agent tool · SKILL.md<br/>(ADR-056 / ADR-072)"]:::accent

  MAN --> DISC["Discovery tiers (spec-extension-loading §2.1)<br/>later tiers shadow earlier for the same noun"]:::data
  DISC --> T1["builtin<br/>src/axiom/extensions/builtins/"]:::data
  T1 --> T2["PyPI-installed<br/>site-packages package with a manifest"]:::data
  T2 --> T3["user<br/>~/.axi/extensions/"]:::data

